1
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,000
What's all this?

2
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:03,960
You see,

3
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:07,040
weren't we short on latrines before?

4
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,159
I plan to turn my room into a latrine.

5
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:11,519
Come in and take a look.

6
00:01:11,519 --> 00:01:13,200
The Master just passed away,

7
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,760
yet here you are, busy digging a latrine.

8
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,040
What a good Young Master.

9
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,480
I never expected

10
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:52,599
that underneath the Sheng Family's house,

11
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:54,760
such a massive secret room was hidden.

12
00:02:07,879 --> 00:02:11,199
Young Master, this place is like a maze.

13
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,439
It's all dead ends.

14
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:14,319
The Dragon-Seeking Ruler must be broken.

15
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,280
The ruler isn't broken.

16
00:02:31,319 --> 00:02:32,319
The paths are changing.

17
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,319
These walls

18
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:38,879
seem to be moving slowly.

19
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:40,960
We've been going in circles.

20
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:42,120
A Living Maze.

21
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,439
Someone's here.

22
00:03:19,719 --> 00:03:21,639
Guiding Wraith.

23
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,159
This crying sound...

24
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:33,080
is the wind blowing through the cracks,

25
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:35,319
distorted by the strange structure.

26
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:37,840
Not this way.

27
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,560
What are you crying for?

28
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:46,199
The real path is where crying is faintest.

29
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:50,879
Over there.

30
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,599
Lingyu.

31
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:07,759
Now we're just a widow and her orphan.

32
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:10,400
The Sheng Family relies entirely on you.

33
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:15,280
Madam, Master Qi and his son are here.

34
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,720
Oh, Brother Sheng.

35
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,600
How could you just leave us?

36
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,759
Cousin.

37
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:28,000
Sister-in-law, I brought a small gift

38
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:31,759
to comfort Brother Qiufeng's soul.

39
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,560
Thank you. Thank you.

40
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,360
And what about this?

41
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,879
This is a betrothal gift.

42
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:42,879
Since my brother has passed away,

43
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:45,040
I can't just watch a widow and her orphan

44
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,600
suffer like this.

45
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:49,319
The Qi and Sheng Families will now be one.

46
00:04:49,319 --> 00:04:49,759
You...

47
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:52,040
Uncle, my father's body is not yet cold!

48
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,839
Lingyu.

49
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,519
Don't worry.

50
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,680
I'll treat you very well from now on.

51
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:59,439
I'll help you manage the Sheng Family.

52
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,879
I don't agree.

53
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,360
Do you even have a say here?

54
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,879
What right do you have to disagree?

55
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,720
You've only been married in for a few days.

56
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,959
Lingyu was in danger in the secret room,

57
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,519
and Master Sheng died suddenly.

58
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,600
Zhang Tianyou, are you trying to ruin us?

59
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:17,079
Master!

60
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,399
Father!

61
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,600
Master! Master!

62
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,279
Do you still have some unfulfilled wishes?

63
00:05:27,319 --> 00:05:29,360
Brother Sheng's vital energy hasn't faded.

64
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,680
He has something to say.

65
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,480
Quick, take out that...

66
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:33,480
Get the Qi Family Soul-Continuation Talisman!

67
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,319
Here, Father.

68
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,160
Oh, Brother Sheng.

69
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:43,360
Tomorrow our families will be united.

70
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,079
As your brother, I

71
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:45,079
don't have much ability.

72
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:46,839
But the estate you left behind,

73
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,160
I will manage it well for you.

74
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:50,240
Especially your wife and your daughter.

75
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,480
I will take very good care of them for you.

76
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,680
Don't stare at me with such wide eyes.

77
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,199
Say something!

78
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:02,519
Master Qi.

79
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:07,199
You haven't mastered the Qi talisman book.

80
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:10,279
The Soul-Continuation Talisman

81
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:11,560
is drawn like this.

82
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,199
Don't move!

83
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:36,879
Alright.

84
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,240
Rest assured.

85
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,120
This Earth Vein Incantation Scripture...

86
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,360
I've already retrieved it for you.

87
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,120
Earth Vein Incantation Scripture!

88
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,000
Earth Vein Incantation Scripture!

89
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,800
I...

90
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:48,360
Master, I'll look after the Sheng Family.

91
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,959
I will save the Sheng residence. Rest in peace.

92
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:56,720
Master!

93
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,480
Father!

94
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,160
Brother Sheng!

95
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:58,959
Father!

96
00:06:59,399 --> 00:07:00,399
No, Brother Sheng!

97
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:02,759
How could you hand the Sheng Family to him?

98
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,439
Get up and say something!

99
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,160
What are you doing?

100
00:07:08,519 --> 00:07:09,319
Madam Sheng,

101
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:12,079
this kid clearly used dark magic!

102
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:13,000
This isn't normal!

103
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,439
The Master's dying wish is clear.

104
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:16,519
The Sheng Family does not welcome you.

105
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,040
See the guests out!

106
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:18,839
You...

107
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:21,560
Master Qi, Young Master Qi, please.

108
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,360
I... I will be back!

109
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:27,240
Zhang Tianyou, we're not done yet!

110
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,360
Let's go, let's go.

111
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:28,879
Let's go.

112
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:30,040
Go, go, go.

113
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,240
Young Master,

114
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,319
what just happened to Master Sheng...

115
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,480
During rigor mortis,

116
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,720
limbs intermittently react to stimulation.

117
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,000
There's a dead body in here!

118
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,680
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

119
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,480
I'm sorry!

120
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:01,800
What is this?

121
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:09,319
The Sheng Family scripture tossed like trash?

122
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,879
And you were sitting on it?

123
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,120
Tell us.

124
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:21,079
Why is a Sheng Family item in your hands?

125
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,720
Didn't you all just see it?

126
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:26,680
The old man handed the Sheng Family to me.

127
00:08:27,959 --> 00:08:29,079
Just you?

128
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,159
That's right.

129
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,799
Just me.

130
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,919
Zhang Tianyou.

131
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,200
Sheng Lingyu.

132
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,840
If you want to be the Qi Family young madam,

133
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,840
you can go right now.

134
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,639
I won't stop you.

135
00:08:40,639 --> 00:08:44,000
But I'm in charge of the Sheng Family now.

136
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:45,720
Zhang Tianyou,

137
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,440
you almost fooled me.

138
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,320
Zhang Tianyou!

139
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:51,240
Don't think stealing Master's things lets you rule!

140
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,559
Lingyu.

141
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:56,000
The Sheng Family cannot fall to the Qi Family.

142
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,080
And it certainly can't fall to this loser.

143
00:08:58,399 --> 00:09:00,799
Go to the Qi Family now and find Qi Tiankun.

144
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:01,759
Get him under your control.

145
00:09:07,559 --> 00:09:08,720
Understood.

146
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,519
Bastard.

147
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:18,919
I saw this coming.

148
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:20,080
It wouldn't be that easy.

149
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,320
Time to find a new wife.

150
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,120
Young Master,

151
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,440
You know the Sheng Family incantation scriptures,

152
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,919
and understand the Qi Family talisman books.

153
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:57,759
Who exactly are you?

154
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:02,320
Because the Sheng Family incantation scriptures

155
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,919
and the Qi Family's talisman books,

156
00:10:04,399 --> 00:10:06,399
I read them when I was very young.

157
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,279
What did you say?

158
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,679
I said,

159
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:13,639
If we can't gather the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye,

160
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:15,799
and before the next full moon,

161
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:17,519
we can't find the Tidal Tomb,

162
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:20,559
The Four Great Families can't escape their fate.

163
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:26,120
Time is running out.

164
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:41,120
Who is it? Have you no manners?

165
00:10:51,559 --> 00:10:52,360
Who's there?
